OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDuring the morning, extensive
OL,6,Ffog across western parts, and patchier
OL,7,Ffog across the east, will slowly
OL,8,Fdissipate. A bright and sunny
OL,9,Fafternoon will follow, with light
OL,10,Fwinds for most, breezier along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear during the first half
OL,14,Fof the night with light winds,
OL,15,Fallowing fog to form during the latter
OL,16,Fhalf. Feeling cool in rural areas, but
OL,17,Fwarmer in urban areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
