OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA foggy or cloudy start,
OL,6,Fremaining grey for many during the
OL,7,Fafternoon with light winds. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain and drizzle will move in from
OL,9,Fthe north overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA mix
OL,12,Fof sunny spells and cloudy periods,
OL,13,Fwith a moderate to fresh breeze.
OL,14,FShowers are possible at times,
OL,15,Fespecially along the coast, where
OL,16,Fwinds will be stronger.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
